Implement a RESTful API endpoint that handles the creation and retrieval of a user resource. The API endpoint should use the POST method and accept JSON data in the request body for creation, and GET method for retrieval. The request body for creation should contain the user data in the following format:

```json
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "johndoe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
