Develop a custom API endpoint for an online store using Node.js that allows users to add items to their shopping cart. Each item should have a name, price, and quantity. The endpoint should validate that the user is logged in before adding an item to the cart. If the user is not logged in, an error should be returned. Additionally, the endpoint should check if the requested item is in stock before adding it to the cart. If the item is not in stock, an error should be returned.

