Explain the use of webhooks in server-side applications and provide a code example using a specific programming language of your choice. Additionally, your solution should include error handling, demonstrate how the webhook payload can be securely transmitted using encryption, implement a rate limiting mechanism to prevent abuse and ensure fair usage of the webhook endpoint, and optimize the code for efficiency by minimizing time and space complexity.

